{
  "id": "grammar-6",
  "world": "grammar",
  "order": 6,
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "進行式與未來式",
  "titleEn": "Continuous & Future",
  "summary": "「正在做」和「將要做」的說法。",
  "minutes": 15,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "中文概念",
      "body": [
        "中文說「正在」表示動作進行中，英文用 be 動詞 ＋ 動詞-ing。",
        "中文說「將會、要」表示未來，英文用 will ＋ 動詞原形，或 be going to ＋ 動詞原形。",
        "多益常用「現在進行式」描述照片（Part 1），用「未來式」說計畫和公告（Part 3、4）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "簡單說明",
      "body": [
        "記住兩個句型："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "意思",
          "句型",
          "例子"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "正在做",
            "am／is／are ＋ 動詞-ing",
            "She is typing a letter."
          ],
          [
            "過去某時正在做",
            "was／were ＋ 動詞-ing",
            "I was driving at nine."
          ],
          [
            "將會（決定、預測）",
            "will ＋ 動詞原形",
            "The store will open at ten."
          ],
          [
            "打算、計畫",
            "be going to ＋ 動詞原形",
            "We are going to hire two people."
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "時間字提示：now、right now、at the moment → 進行式；tomorrow、next week、soon → 未來式。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "英文例句",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "The man is reading a newspaper.",
          "zh": "那個男人正在看報紙。",
          "highlight": "reading",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-6/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "They are setting up the room.",
          "zh": "他們正在布置房間。",
          "highlight": "setting",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-6/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "The meeting will start at three.",
          "zh": "會議將在三點開始。",
          "highlight": "will",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-6/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "We are going to move next month.",
          "zh": "我們下個月要搬家。",
          "highlight": "going",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-6/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "breakdown",
      "title": "句子拆解",
      "items": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "A woman",
              "label": "主詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "is",
              "label": "be 動詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "watering",
              "label": "動詞-ing（正在澆水）"
            },
            {
              "text": "the plants.",
              "label": "受詞"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "Part 1 照片題最常見的句型"
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "The new branch",
              "label": "主詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "will",
              "label": "將會"
            },
            {
              "text": "open",
              "label": "動詞原形"
            },
            {
              "text": "next month.",
              "label": "未來時間"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "will 後面一定接動詞原形"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contrast",
      "title": "正確與錯誤示範",
      "items": [
        {
          "wrong": "She is type a letter.",
          "right": "She is typing a letter.",
          "why": "is 後面要接動詞-ing。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "The bus will arrives soon.",
          "right": "The bus will arrive soon.",
          "why": "will 後面接動詞原形 arrive。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "We going to call you.",
          "right": "We are going to call you.",
          "why": "going to 前面要有 be 動詞 are。"
        }
      ]
    },
